	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Silvertel Ag59800-LPB series (Ag59812-LPB, Ag59824-LPB) IEEE 802.3bt Type 4 Class 8 PoE PD module, SMT, 50.6x30 mm. Land pattern from datasheet V2.0 figure 17. The isolation keep-out covers both the tabulated and the drawn stripe on the module-facing copper layer and the adjacent inner layer (F.Cu + In1.Cu here; B.Cu + In2.Cu when the module is mounted on the bottom). Keep vias out of it on every layer. Datasheet p19: solder-mask-defined pads preferred (pads 1-3, 8 and 9 have -0.075 mm mask and paste margins; on the board, the pours make pads 4-7 mask-defined), minimal thermal relief, never reflow the module hanging upside down (on the bottom side: solder it last or by hand) (https://silvertel.com/images/datasheets/Ag59800-LPB%20-datasheet-high%20efficiency%20SMT%20IEEE802_3BT%20100W%20power-over-ethernet%20module.pdf)")
	(tags "Silvertel PoE PD module power-over-ethernet IEEE802.3bt class 8 Ag59812 Ag59824")
